# Your Cloud Bill Keeps Climbing With No Clear Reason

Canonical source: https://webworldmaker.com/problem/cloud-cost-overrun/
Scope: Machine-readable mirror of claims visible on the canonical human page.

Cloud costs creep up through over-provisioned instances, forgotten resources, unoptimized storage tiers, and services scaled for peak load that run at that size around the clock. Without regular cost review, this drift becomes a permanent, invisible tax on the budget.